From 732a39764ace82b646ddf4e38c440cf12ea456be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: batya <batya@github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 17:10:42 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 03/16] fix(ui): a part is never offered for separation again

A stem is itself the result of a separation, so splitting it again only makes
copies of copies. The track menu no longer shows "Split into stems" for a part,
and the tools panel states why instead of offering the button. The raw record
the tools panel loads carries no derived mark, so the check goes through the
app's one mapper, the same way every other screen reads it.
